{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"NotFoundComponent"},{"type":"text","value":" component is a component that renders when a not-found error occurs in a route."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"notfoundcomponent-props","children":[{"type":"text","value":"NotFoundComponent props"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"NotFoundComponent"},{"type":"text","value":" component accepts the following props:"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"props-data-prop","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"props.data"},{"type":"text","value":" prop"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Custom data that is passed to the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"notFoundComponent"},{"type":"text","value":" when the not-found error is handled"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This data comes from the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"data"},{"type":"text","value":" property of the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"NotFoundError"},{"type":"text","value":" object"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"props-isnotfound-prop","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"props.isNotFound"},{"type":"text","value":" prop"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Required"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A boolean value indicating whether the current state is a not-found error state"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This value is always "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"true"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"props-routeid-prop","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"props.routeId"},{"type":"text","value":" prop"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RouteIds<RegisteredRouter['routeTree']>"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Required"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The ID of the route that is attempting to handle the not-found error"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Must be one of the valid route IDs from the router's route tree"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"notfoundcomponent-returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"NotFoundComponent returns"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns appropriate UI for not-found error situations"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Typically includes a \"page not found\" message along with links to go home or navigate to previous pages"}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"notfoundcomponent-props","text":"NotFoundComponent props","level":2},{"id":"props-data-prop","text":"props.data prop","level":3},{"id":"props-isnotfound-prop","text":"props.isNotFound prop","level":3},{"id":"props-routeid-prop","text":"props.routeId prop","level":3},{"id":"notfoundcomponent-returns","text":"NotFoundComponent returns","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe `NotFoundComponent` component is a component that renders when a not-found error occurs in a route.\n\n## NotFoundComponent props\n\nThe `NotFoundComponent` component accepts the following props:\n\n### `props.data` prop\n\n- Type: `unknown`\n- Optional\n- Custom data that is passed to the `notFoundComponent` when the not-found error is handled\n- This data comes from the `data` property of the `NotFoundError` object\n\n### `props.isNotFound` prop\n\n- Type: `boolean`\n- Required\n- A boolean value indicating whether the current state is a not-found error state\n- This value is always `true`\n\n### `props.routeId` prop\n\n- Type: `RouteIds<RegisteredRouter['routeTree']>`\n- Required\n- The ID of the route that is attempting to handle the not-found error\n- Must be one of the valid route IDs from the router's route tree\n\n## NotFoundComponent returns\n\n- Returns appropriate UI for not-found error situations\n- Typically includes a \"page not found\" message along with links to go home or navigate to previous pages\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: notFoundComponentComponent\ntitle: NotFoundComponent component\n---\n\nThe `NotFoundComponent` component is a component that renders when a not-found error occurs in a route.\n\n## NotFoundComponent props\n\nThe `NotFoundComponent` component accepts the following props:\n\n### `props.data` prop\n\n- Type: `unknown`\n- Optional\n- Custom data that is passed to the `notFoundComponent` when the not-found error is handled\n- This data comes from the `data` property of the `NotFoundError` object\n\n### `props.isNotFound` prop\n\n- Type: `boolean`\n- Required\n- A boolean value indicating whether the current state is a not-found error state\n- This value is always `true`\n\n### `props.routeId` prop\n\n- Type: `RouteIds<RegisteredRouter['routeTree']>`\n- Required\n- The ID of the route that is attempting to handle the not-found error\n- Must be one of the valid route IDs from the router's route tree\n\n## NotFoundComponent returns\n\n- Returns appropriate UI for not-found error situations\n- Typically includes a \"page not found\" message along with links to go home or navigate to previous pages\n"}
